Let's see if I understand this statement:

Death by stoning never generates a death drop, so when you hit a
monster with a rubber chicken you never get a statue plus a random
item.  If true, this is a good reason to avoid using a rubber chicken
except when you're in trouble or facing a very powerfull opponent.

Most monsters don't have inventories so most monsters would
leave a statue that only gives rocks.  Many monsters have a chance
of getting a random item.  Many types have specific starting items.
For example troll types have a 50% chance of getting a polearm
and if they do it has even odds among 4 types.  (For polearm
users this is a great source of a spetum, the polearm with the best
ratio of damage per weight.  Appartently spetums are light).



